@startuml state
[*] --> Tokenized
Tokenized --> Parsed: parse() Ok
Tokenized --> LexError: lex fail
LexError --> [*]
Parsed --> Planned: plan() Ok
Parsed --> ParseError: parse fail
ParseError --> [*]
Planned --> Executed: execute() Ok
Planned --> SemanticError: catalog fail
SemanticError --> [*]
Executed --> [*]
@enduml
